# @olie/cockpit

Internal admin panel. Vue 3 + TS, Vite 7. Consumes `@olie/ui` like management. **Still has no `CLAUDE.md`** — treat it as a smaller sibling of `@olie/management`.

## How to work

- Reuse patterns from `packages/management` and `management.mdc` rules when they fit (Composition + `<script setup>`, services, aliases)
- Shared components/directives/services → `@olie/ui`, do not copy from management
- Lint: `yarn lint-cockpit` (`vue-tsc` + eslint). The `vue-tsc` binary is hoisted from management — bumps there affect cockpit
- Dev hostname: `cockpit.olie.localhost` (internal port 5171)
- `front-cockpit` container may use an anonymous `node_modules` volume in compose → rebuild if deps do not show up

When unsure, mirror the equivalent management file or ask before inventing a cockpit-only pattern.
